{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15904","headline":"主人故亭 · 王建","name":"主人故亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人昔专城，城南起高亭。\n贵与宾客游，工者夜不宁。\n酒食宴圃人，栽接望早成。\n经年使家僮，远道求异英。\n郡中暂闲暇，遶树引诸生。\n开泉浴山禽，爲爱山中声。\n世间事难保，一日各徂征。\n死生不相及，花落实方荣。\n我来至此中，守吏非本名。\n重君昔爲主，相与下马行。\n旧岛日日摧，池水不复清。\n岂无後人赏，所贵手自营。\n浇酒向所思，风起如有灵。\n此去不重来，重来伤我形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}